<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Resources on Spine Event Engine</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/resources/</link><description>Recent content in Resources on Spine Event Engine</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://spine.io/docs/resources/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Blogs</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/resources/blogs/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/resources/blogs/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="blogs" data-title&gt;&#10;Blogs&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="note-block lead"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The ideas unfolding in real time&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://dddweekly.com/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Domain Driven Design Weekly&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;The periodical digest of articles and materials on DDD by Nick Chamberlain.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://martinfowler.com/tags/domain%20driven%20design.html"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Martin Fowler on Domain-Driven Design&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.avanscoperta.it/it/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Avanscoperta blog&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;The blog by Alberto Brandolini and his colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Books</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/resources/books/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/resources/books/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="books" data-title&gt;&#10;Books&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="note-block lead"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Key works to get familiar with the approach.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="book-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="book"&#10; href="https://www.amazon.com/Domain-Driven-Design-Tackling-Complexity-Software/dp/0321125215"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://spine.io/img/docs/resources/books/ddd-design.png"&#10; class="book-cover"&#10; alt="Domain-Driven Design book"&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="book-info"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="book-title"&#10; href="https://www.amazon.com/Domain-Driven-Design-Tackling-Complexity-Software/dp/0321125215"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Domain-Driven Design&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;p class="book-subtitle"&gt;Tackling Complexity in the Heart of Software&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="author"&gt;by Eric Evans&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="description"&gt;The Big Blue Book that lays the basics of the Domain-Driven Design methodology.&#10;It provides a broad framework for making design decisions and a vocabulary for&#10;discussing domain design.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="book-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="book"&#10; href="https://www.amazon.com/Domain-Driven-Design-Reference-Definitions-Summaries/dp/1457501198"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://spine.io/img/docs/resources/books/ddd-design-reference.png"&#10; class="book-cover"&#10; alt="Domain-Driven Design Reference book"&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="book-info"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="book-title"&#10; href="https://www.amazon.com/Domain-Driven-Design-Reference-Definitions-Summaries/dp/1457501198"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Domain-Driven Design Reference&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="author"&gt;by Eric Evans&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="description"&gt;This book provides a brief overview of the DDD methodology.&#10;It also defines the terms, which were coined in this topic since 2004.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Communities</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/resources/communities/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/resources/communities/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="communities" data-title&gt;&#10;Communities&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="note-block lead"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Places to discuss DDD with other practitioners&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://virtualddd.com/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Virtual DDD&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="lang"&gt;(EN)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#10;A community-driven online meetup for people who want to get more in-depth knowledge of DDD&#10;from anywhere at any time.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://groups.google.com/g/dddcqrs?pli=1"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;DDD/CQRS Google Group&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="lang"&gt;(EN)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#10;A mailing list with practical discussions on DDD, CQRS and Event Sourcing.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://dddi.dev/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Domain-Driven Design Injection&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="lang"&gt;(RU)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#10;Our own community for developers and engineers who look for new ways of solving non-trivial software design tasks.&#10;&lt;a href="https://dddi.dev/logbook"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Regular meetups&lt;/a&gt; are held online. The discussion in between the meetups continues in the&#10;&lt;a href="https://messroom.dddi.dev/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;DDDi Messroom&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/dddevotion"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;DDDevotion&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="lang"&gt;(RU)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#10;A community, dedicated to DDD, engineering practices, and technical excellence.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Libraries and Frameworks</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/resources/libraries/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/resources/libraries/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="libraries-and-frameworks" data-title&gt;&#10;Libraries and Frameworks&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="note-block lead"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Other tools that help with DDD in code&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://axoniq.io/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Axon&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;Open-source framework for event-driven microservices and domain-driven design.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://vlingo.io/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Vlingo&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;The open-source toolkit by Vaughn Vernon for fluent reactive, event-driven,&#10;and microservices architectures.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://eventstore.com/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;EventStore&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;The stream database by Greg Young built for Event Sourcing.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>People</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/resources/people/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/resources/people/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="people" data-title&gt;&#10;People&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="note-block lead"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The creators and drivers of the DDD ideas.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="person-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;img class="avatar"&#10; src="https://spine.io/img/docs/resources/people/eric-evans.png"&#10; alt="Eric Evans photo"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="person-info"&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Eric Evans&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="social-networks"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://domainlanguage.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="far fa-globe"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://x.com/ericevans0" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fab fa-twitter"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;The author of the DDD methodology. Domain linguist. The author&#10;of “Domain-Driven Design: Tackling Complexity in the Heart of Software”.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="person-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;img class="avatar"&#10; src="https://spine.io/img/docs/resources/people/vaughn-vernon.png"&#10; alt="Vaughn Vernon photo"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="person-info"&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Vaughn Vernon&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="social-networks"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://github.com/VaughnVernon" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fab fa-github"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://x.com/VaughnVernon" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fab fa-twitter"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Domain Model Whisperer. The author of “Implementing Domain-Driven Design”&#10;and “Domain-Driven Design Distilled”. Founder of &lt;a href="https://vlingo.io/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Vlingo Platform&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="person-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;img class="avatar"&#10; src="https://spine.io/img/docs/resources/people/greg-young.png"&#10; alt="Greg Young photo"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="person-info"&gt;&#10; &lt;h3&gt;Greg Young&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="social-networks"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://github.com/gregoryyoung" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fab fa-github"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a href="https://x.com/gregyoung" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fab fa-twitter"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Creator of CQRS and the driver of Event Sourcing.&#10;Founder of the &lt;a href="https://eventstore.com/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Event Store&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sites</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/resources/sites/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/resources/sites/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="sites" data-title&gt;&#10;Sites&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="note-block lead"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Learning hubs&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://dddcommunity.org/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;DDD Community&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;A collection of resources by Eric Evans and his colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.infoq.com/domain-driven-design/"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Domain Driven Design On InfoQ&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;DDD section on one of the leading media on software development.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/heynickc/awesome-ddd"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Awesome Domain-Driven Design&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;An extensive curated list of DDD, CQRS, Event Sourcing, and EventStorming resources.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://emacsway.github.io/ru/self-learning-for-software-engineer/#ddd"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;Learning DDD&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;A selection of learning materials for gradual immersion into the topic: from the basics to the specific design cases.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>